{"text":{"en":{"머신드 타입 니들 롤러 베어링 (분리형) | [회사명] 베어링":"Machined Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable) | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Machined Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable)</p> <h2>머신드 타입 니들 롤러 베어링 (분리형)</h2> <p>니들 롤러 케이지와 내륜, 외륜이 서로 분리 가능한 형식입니다.</p> <p>내륜 포함(NAF/NAFW)과 내륜 없음(RNAF/RNAFW) 두 형태로 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Machined Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable)</p> <h2>Machined Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable)</h2> <p>A type in which the needle roller cage, inner ring, and outer ring are separable from one another.</p> <p>Supplied in two forms: with inner ring (NAF/NAFW) and without inner ring (RNAF/RNAFW).</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just the model number or part of the dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/machined_needle_separate.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS catalog specification drawing</p> <img src=\"img/machined_needle_separate.png\" alt=\"Structural cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(bore) · D(outer diameter) · Tolerance (d/D) · B(width)</p>","<label for=\"mnsFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"mnsFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: NAF102213 또는 14*22\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"mnsFilter\">Model / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"mnsFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. NAF102213 or 14*22\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"mnsCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\